      "value": "@{64f115d7f5baf90a329bbdf0|full_name}: I have read the entire thing, and it really doesn't sound like that's what you meant. Even if it is, it's still a very bad idea. \n\nMore paywalling is a bad idea no matter the feature.\n\nVRChat is a SOCIAL game, not some game that \"needs\" P2W features.\n\nWe don't want another EA in the world, do we?\n\nYou end your post with explaining that this is a good way of getting more people to spend money on VRChat, which may be true, but remember when VRC+ originally was introduced and most of the community was mad?\n\nYeah that same thing happens still when VRC releases a new thing that's VRC+ only.\n\nNo matter the way I look at this, I still see this as a terrible idea.\n\nHave a good day.",
